7592186045417] [17592186404156 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186404157 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404156 #edb/ref 1069 "q-81273" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404156 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404156 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the locations of all of the critical points of $T,$ where $T$ is defined as\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}{u}^{2}\\,\\,v \\\\ u+{v}^{2}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404156 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "82fb995e-103e-58b4-a8e9-4c6b2963c1a3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404156 #edb/ref 1074 "Given a transformation \n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]\\to [\\begin{aligned}x(u,v) \\\\ y(u,v)\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nthe Jacobian determinant of $T,$ denoted $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)},$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTo find the locations of the critical points of $T,$ we need to solve \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}=0.\n$$\n\nHere, we have $x(u,v)={u}^{2}\\,\\,v$ and $y(u,v)=u+{v}^{2}.$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & =2uv & \\,\\frac{∂x}{∂v} & ={u}^{2} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & =1 & \\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =2v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2uv & {u}^{2} \\\\ 1 & 2v\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2uv\\cdot 2v-{u}^{2}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =4u{v}^{2}-{u}^{2} \\\\  & =u(4{v}^{2}-u).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe function has critical points when $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}=0.$ So, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =0 \\\\ u(4{v}^{2}-u) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThe equation $u(4{v}^{2}-u)=0$ defines a pair of intersecting curves in the $uv$-plane: the line $u=0$ and the parabola $u=4{v}^{2}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404157 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404158 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404157 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404159 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404157 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404160 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404157 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404161 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404157 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404162 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404157 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404157 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404157 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186404162 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404157 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "3dd706ed-a6fa-5777-8fba-b9aa9ded06db" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404158 #edb/ref 1080 "The critical points lie on the lines $u=v$ and $u=-v.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404158 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404158 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5a499ca4-07df-5c8d-b83c-a9910cc2fe6f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404159 #edb/ref 1080 "The critical points lie on the lines $u=0$ and $u=v.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404159 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404159 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2cf255f1-3d51-5826-98c1-93901517d605" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404160 #edb/ref 1080 "The critical points lie on the parabola $u={v}^{2}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404160 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404160 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5da5054c-581f-5f31-9886-dad4f588043d" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
